<https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/#a-simple-method-for-quickly-estimating-solar-irradiance-forecast-errors> a schema:BlogPosting ;
    schema:abstract "Des modèles linéaires prédisent l'erreur de prévision du rayonnement à partir de la variabilité locale, mesurée par l'écart-type des variations horaires de l'indice de ciel clair.",
        "Researchers have developed linear models that predict solar irradiance forecast errors using only solar variability at a specific location. This variability is measured by the standard deviation of hourly changes in the clear sky index, essentially capturing how much solar conditions fluctuate hour to hour." ;
    schema:author [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Richard Perez" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Philippe Lauret" ;
            schema:sameAs "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2959-6146" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Elke Lorenz" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Mathieu David" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Mathieu David" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Josselin Le Gal La Salle" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Elke Lorenz" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Philippe Lauret" ;
            schema:sameAs "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2959-6146" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Richard Perez" ],
        [ a schema:Person ;
            schema:name "Josselin Le Gal La Salle" ],
        <https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant> ;
    schema:datePublished "2025-08-22" ;
    schema:headline "A Simple Method for Quickly Estimating Solar Irradiance Forecast Errors",
        "Estimer rapidement l'erreur d'une prévision solaire à partir de la seule variabilité du site" ;
    schema:image "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/assets/img/85e5d66681cc.png" ;
    schema:inLanguage "en" ;
    schema:url "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/#a-simple-method-for-quickly-estimating-solar-irradiance-forecast-errors" .

<https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/#academic-visibility-why-publishing-isn-t-enough-anymore> a schema:BlogPosting ;
    schema:abstract "I've experienced this troubling phenomenon firsthand: an article I had little hope for exploded with hundreds of citations, while another piece I considered my best work remained in obscurity. After twenty years of research, one thing is clear: in a rapidly evolving academic ecosystem, publishing alone is no longer sufficient.",
        "Un article sans grand espoir cité des centaines de fois, un autre, jugé meilleur, resté dans l'ombre : après vingt ans de recherche, publier ne suffit plus, il faut être trouvé et lu." ;
    schema:author <https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant> ;
    schema:datePublished "2025" ;
    schema:headline "Academic Visibility: Why Publishing Isn't Enough Anymore",
        "Visibilité académique : pourquoi publier ne suffit plus" ;
    schema:image "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/assets/img/0e72a8bbd5be.png" ;
    schema:inLanguage "en" ;
    schema:url "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/#academic-visibility-why-publishing-isn-t-enough-anymore" .

