<https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/#scientific-publishing-trust> a schema:BlogPosting ;
    schema:abstract "Indexed articles grew by about 47% between 2016 and 2022, peer review relies on unpaid work and 2023 set a record of retractions. A short essay on what exists, from FAIR data to the AI Act, and what is missing: checking the data and code behind what is published.",
        "Les articles indexés ont crû d'environ 47 % entre 2016 et 2022, la relecture repose sur un travail gratuit et 2023 a battu le record des rétractations. Un court essai sur ce qui existe, des données FAIR à l'AI Act, et ce qui manque : vérifier les données et le code publiés." ;
    schema:author <https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant> ;
    schema:datePublished "2026-10-24" ;
    schema:headline "Scientific publishing: no verification of data and code, no trust",
        "Édition scientifique : sans vérification des données et du code, pas de confiance" ;
    schema:inLanguage "en",
        "fr" ;
    schema:url "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/#scientific-publishing-trust" .

<https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/#stochastic-coefficient-of-variation-assessing-the-variability-and> a schema:BlogPosting ;
    schema:abstract "Le sCV et la prévisibilité F séparent les fluctuations aléatoires des tendances déterministes que l'écart-type mélange, pour caractériser un site avant de comparer des modèles.",
        "This work presents a robust framework for quantifying solar irradiance variability and forecastability through the Stochastic Coefficient of Variation (sCV) and the Forecastability (F). Traditional metrics, such as the standard deviation, fail to isolate stochastic fluctuations from deterministic trends in solar irradiance. By considering clear-sky irradiance as a dynamic upper bound of measurement, sCV provides a normalized, dimensionless measure of variability that theoretically ranges from 0 " ;
